  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace-building and Sustainable Livelihoods Development for Displaced Women in Sahn Malen Chiefdom, Pujehun, Southern</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCSL focuses predominantly on issues of truth, justice and freedom and take their responsibility as &#x2018;moral guarantor for the peace of our nation very seriously, realizing that peace can thrive beyond the absence of war and conflict. It is in justice, truth, and freedom that peace is derived.&#xa0; As a Church CCSL advocates on socio-political factors that affect the ordinary person especially access to basic social services &#x2013; the &#x2018;bread-and-butter&#x2019; issues.
CCSL had wide range of experience in peace building, relief, rehabilitation, conflict management, post conflict development and has practical experiences of managing related projects within these domain.</narrative>
  </description>
